{"id":"ba2db76478a6200d","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-representation-strong.md","title":"Strong Representability","display":"thm-representation-strong — Strong Representability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-representation-strong","aliases":["92-thm-representation-strong"],"display":"thm-representation-strong — Strong Representability","depends_on":["[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-thm-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-representation-strong"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-representation-strong</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-representation-strong — Strong Representability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (system G and its axiom set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec},\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec},\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (decidability and strong numeralwise-representability predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representation\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representation\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强可表示性：可判定集可被公式&quot;完全决定&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\)</span>已在<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>中用无捕获代入展开为逐个numeral证明正确的正、负实例；本定理不再复制一份易漂移的公式</li>\n<li>经典理论本来就证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(\\varphi(x)\\lor\\neg\\varphi(x))\">\\(\\forall x(\\varphi(x)\\lor\\neg\\varphi(x))\\)</span>；该排中律不表达集合的可判定性，故从结论中删除</li>\n<li>这是从可判定性到强表示性的定理；反向一般需要可靠性等额外条件，不能称为无条件“双向刻画”</li>\n<li>用于证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>能讨论所有可判定性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-representability","status":"resolved","id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)$已在[[92-df-representable]]中用无捕获代入展开为逐个numeral证明正确的正、负实例；本定理不再复制一份易漂移的公式","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec},\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representation\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(\\varphi(x)\\lor\\neg\\varphi(x))","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]]\n[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-unprovable.md]]\n[[92-thm-representability.md]]\n[[92-thm-representation-strong.md]]\n[[92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness.md]]\n[[92-thm-simple-not-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-sound-implies-consistent.md]]\n[[92-thm-substitution-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[92-thm-truth-undefinable.md]]\n[[92-thm-turing-progress.md]]"}],"outgoing":["d9d845f6cd765d21","b090f61b9f3ec664","468d35690d25ee42","e0eabee5d77258a7","35c764f4e9f21f28","0b2170bf5b3075ce"]}